# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Add your API key to .env
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here

# Start the server
uvicorn app.main:app --reload

# Don't forget to turn on VPN on the region that doesn't support your LLM

# pip install --upgrade anthropic


# app/main.py
────────────
Simple FastAPI backend: Text → Graph

Endpoints:
  POST /generate   — submit text, get diagram graph back immediately
  GET  /results    — list all past results (stored in memory)
  GET  /result/{job_id} — get a specific past result
  GET  /health     — health check

Storage: simple in-memory dict (resets on server restart).
No queue, no database, no background tasks — runs synchronously.


# planner
──────────────────────
Multi-provider LLM agent. Supports:
  - Google Gemini  (free)
  - Groq           (free)
  - Ollama         (local, free)
  - Anthropic      (paid)

Provider is selected by LLM_PROVIDER in .env


# app/agents/chart_planner.py
────────────────────────────
Extracts structured chart data from text using the configured LLM provider.
Returns a chart spec: { chart_type, title, x_label, y_label, data: [{label, value}] }

# flow
POST /generate-graph
1. main.py: generate_graph -> try: run_graph_planner
2. graph_planner.py: 
  2.1 run_graph_planner -> (with provider groq)
  2.2 raw = _extract_json
  2.3 spec = _validate
  2.4 algo_result = _run_algorithm
  2.5 run_graph_planner -> spec = _apply_algorithm_result(spec, algo_result)
  2.6 _apply_algorithm_result(spec, algo_result) -> return spec
  2.7 run_graph_planner -> return spec, tokens
3. main.py: generate_graph -> return {"job_id": job_id, "graph": spec, "tokens_used": tokens}


